// Glyph data adapted from the Hack-a-Day 2022 Supercon.6 "Hamlet" text
// scroller demo by Voja Antonic (upstream examples/Hackaday-hamlet).  Each
// glyph is five bytes; bit 7 is the top row and bit 0 the bottom row.
// ASCII 32..127 are present, in order.  The table is split in two so every
// access uses an 8-bit flash index.

